Workers started in `init()` dequeue from `asyncPostQueue` and call `Post` for each payload.

Protection from internal/reserved addresses is enforced at dial time by `safeDialContext`, wired into the shared `safeClient` transport. It resolves the target hostname and rejects any address in a reserved/private range via `isReservedIP`:

